OL,3,GNEWSALondon Stadium to increase
OL,4,Aconcerts to cut losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Stadium will be able to double
OL,7,Fthe number of concerts it hosts each
OL,8,Fyear, after plans were put to the
OL,9,Fcouncil in a bid to cut annual losses
OL,10,Fof approximately #19m.
OL,12,FThe venue's operator applied to change
OL,13,Fits planning permission to allow up to
OL,14,F24 non-sporting events a year, up from
OL,15,F10, due to losses that it attributed to
OL,16,Fthe long-term deal signed with West Ham
OL,17,Fover the use of the stadium in
OL,18,FStratford, east London.
OL,20,FThe plans were approved unanimously on
OL,21,FMonday night by Newham Council's
OL,22,Fstrategic development committee.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
