OL,3,GNEWSALondon Stadium to increase
OL,4,Aconcerts to cut losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey were recommended for approval by
OL,7,Fplanning officers, who said the
OL,8,Fincrease in concerts would support the
OL,9,Fwider Olympic Park, Stratford and
OL,10,FNewham's tourist economy.
